cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite the DataWill specification, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DataWill: an open format for digital will declarations"
abstract: "DataWill is an experimental, open, machine-readable format for describing who should receive access to which digital assets, under which conditions and with which proofs. Version 0.1 is a draft specification with a JSON Schema and examples. It is not a standard and has not been audited."
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
authors:
